<https://wazootech.github.io/wiki/Graph_Cache> <https://schema.org/description> "In-process RDF graph reuse plus optional on-disk warm-start across repeated CLI runs." .
<https://wazootech.github.io/wiki/Graph_Cache> <https://schema.org/headline> "Graph Cache" .
<https://wazootech.github.io/wiki/Graph_Cache> <https://schema.org/dateCreated> "2026-06-02T20:06:59Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
