<https://wazootech.github.io/wiki/OWL> <https://schema.org/headline> "OWL" .
<https://wazootech.github.io/wiki/OWL> <https://schema.org/dateCreated> "2026-05-09T21:06:44Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
