<https://wazootech.github.io/wiki/wiki> <https://schema.org/codeRepository> <https://github.com/wazootech/wiki> .
<https://wazootech.github.io/wiki/wiki> <https://schema.org/headline> "wiki" .
<https://wazootech.github.io/wiki/wiki> <https://schema.org/dateCreated> "2026-06-02T20:06:59Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
